{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/37595-how-does-a-god-is-born","id":37595,"title":"How does a God is born?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-26T18:36:17-08:00","id":37595,"title":"How does a God is born?","content":"im writting the &quot;New Gods.&quot; for my setting (Basically, old gods vs new ones). and a friend told me that the concept of Sex could be a god. that got me to think, on Scion..how does a God is born? or what concepts Can become gods","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T21:57:08-08:00","id":37692,"title":"","content":"If it exists, a god can come of it.<br /> <br /> The origins of Gods tends to vary with the culture and religion. A common trend is that they ALWAYS existed. Because from the point of view of ancient people (and indeed, most modern people) there's always been the Sun, Moon and Stars and other things people study and worship.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T22:20:53-08:00","id":37705,"title":"","content":"Or at the very least pre-date peoples' memories, which is about 6-7 generations (so over 100 years) in pre-writing societies. It depends on the idiosyncrasies of the culture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/889-dayen","name":"Dayen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T22:21:03-08:00","id":37706,"title":"","content":"You're going to be dealing with a very different view from base Scion if you're writing for a game based on American Gods. In there, Gods come into being spontaneously as a result of humanity in sufficient numbers <i>believing</i> that they <i>should</i> exist. If enough people really, truly believe in Media as a Goddess, she'll come into being. <br /> <br /> That is not how base Scion works. According to Scion, Gods are created when Gods reproduce with other Gods or when Titan Avatars split themselves away from their parent Titan. The very oldest Gods have origins in the primordial chaos that existed at the beginning of time, the newer ones are evolved or descended from those. They can also just be the children of Titans, or even Scions that have reached Legend 9.<br /> <br /> In base Scion, Media, TechBoy, the Railroad Barons, the Airplane Gods and the other Modern Gods that Neil Gaiman created wouldn't exist. They could be imagined as ascended Scions, or modern-era offspring of old Gods, but they wouldn't just come into being as they did in the book. His universe follows different rules from Scion's.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T02:03:45-08:00","id":37766,"title":"","content":"Hopefully, <b>Scion 2e</b> won\u2019t change this. <br /> <br /> Also, Hopefully <b>Scion 2e</b> will eventually get a variant setting that <i>does</i> use this premise, if only to more clearly provide the contrast between how <b>Scion</b> works and how something like <i>American Gods</i> works. This Shard would be the setting where the likes of Santa Claus and Uncle Sam reside.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T06:00:42-08:00","id":37812,"title":"","content":"*shrugs*<br /> Depending upon pantheon/culture, some gods were born from the ice, some from out of the dark, some from a watery abyss. Or they were always eternal.<br /> <i>Which came first, the phoenix or the egg?<br /> Luna's reply; &quot;A circle has neither end nor beginning.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}